280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a41374cf828233e6\" href=\"?note=a41374cf828233e6\" title=\"17-df-type-realization\">17-df-type-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"de5d3e9530a68ea0\" href=\"?note=de5d3e9530a68ea0\" title=\"17-df-non-isolated-types\">17-df-non-isolated-types</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0626faf5263e31f8\" href=\"?note=0626faf5263e31f8\" title=\"17-df-omega-stability\">17-df-omega-stability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-7.1.5b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\">\\(p\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\)</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> (sentences, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Consistent}\">\\(\\operatorname{Consistent}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span> (consistency and models, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_n(T)\">\\(S_n(T)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Realized}\">\\(\\operatorname{Realized}\\)</span> (complete types and realization, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"a41374cf828233e6\" href=\"?note=a41374cf828233e6\" title=\"17-df-type-realization\">17-df-type-realization</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NonIsolated}_T\">\\(\\operatorname{NonIsolated}_T\\)</span> (non-isolated type predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"de5d3e9530a68ea0\" href=\"?note=de5d3e9530a68ea0\" title=\"17-df-non-isolated-types\">17-df-non-isolated-types</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sym}(L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sym}(L)\\)</span> (language symbol set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"e8f9375543fc2e7d\" href=\"?note=e8f9375543fc2e7d\" title=\"17-df-language-cardinality\">17-df-language-cardinality</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\cdot|,\\aleph_0\">\\(|\\cdot|,\\aleph_0\\)</span> (cardinality notions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Consistent}(T)\n\\land\n|\\operatorname{Sym}(L)|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\np\\in S_n(T)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{NonIsolated}_T(p)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak A|\\,\\bigr|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\n\\neg\\operatorname{Realized}_{\\mathfrak A}(p)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Consistent}(T)\n\\land\n|\\operatorname{Sym}(L)|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\np\\in S_n(T)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{NonIsolated}_T(p)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak A|\\,\\bigr|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\n\\neg\\operatorname{Realized}_{\\mathfrak A}(p)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The theorem produces a countable model omitting the specified non-isolated complete type. <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Omit}\">\\(\\operatorname{Omit}\\)</span> is not introduced as a theorem-local primitive.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-language-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"e8f9375543fc2e7d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-language-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-theory-properties","status":"resolved","id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-theory-properties]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"07adad8c036296f7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-type-realization","status":"resolved","id":"a41374cf828233e6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-type-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-non-isolated-types","status":"resolved","id":"de5d3e9530a68ea0","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-non-isolated-types]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-omega-stability","status":"resolved","id":"0626faf5263e31f8","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-omega-stability]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-10","targetAncho